			<item>
				<title>011 A Shift in Dimension. Transiting from the Linearity of Projects to the Autonomy of Systems</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/en/docs/core-recalibration/011-2026-a-shift-in-dimension-transiting-from-the-linearity-of-projects-to-the-autonomy-of-systems/</link>
